<table border="0" width="100%">
<tr>
<td  bgcolor="#00FFCC"><strong>練習：運営委員会(会津里花)</strong>  <i>2001/05/09 00:52:01</i><br></td>
<td bgcolor="#00CCFF" width="10%" align="center" nowrap>
